
# Schema Documentation

## MongoDB Models

The backend uses Mongoose to define the following MongoDB schemas:

### `User`

*   `name`: `String` (required)
*   `email`: `String` (required, unique)
*   `password`: `String` (required, select: false)
*   `role`: `String` (enum: 'student', 'admin', 'staff', default: 'student')
*   `college`: `String` (required for students and staff)
*   `department`: `String`
*   `careerTrack`: `String` (enum: 'fullstack', 'ai-ml', 'ui-ux', 'data-science')
*   `level`: `String` (enum: 'Beginner', 'Intermediate', 'Advanced', default: 'Beginner')
*   `interests`: `[String]`
*   `profileComplete`: `Boolean` (default: false)
*   `streakDays`: `Number` (default: 0)
*   `totalPoints`: `Number` (default: 0)
*   `lastActive`: `Date` (default: Date.now)
*   `isActive`: `Boolean` (default: true)
*   `avatar`: `String`
*   `phone`: `String`
*   `location`: `String`
*   `gpa`: `String`
*   `graduationYear`: `String`
*   `activeTodayMinutes`: `Number` (default: 0)
*   `activeTodayDate`: `Date`

### `Track`

*   `name`: `String` (required)
*   `description`: `String` (required)
*   `duration`: `String` (required)
*   `difficulty`: `String` (enum: 'Beginner', 'Intermediate', 'Advanced', required)
*   `averageSalary`: `String` (required)
*   `careerPaths`: `[String]` (required)
*   `skills`: `[String]` (required)
*   `prerequisites`: `[String]`
*   `curriculum`: `[ObjectId]` (ref: 'Curriculum')
*   `enrolledStudents`: `[ObjectId]` (ref: 'User')
*   `isActive`: `Boolean` (default: true)
*   `order`: `Number` (default: 0)

### `Curriculum`

*   `title`: `String` (required)
*   `description`: `String` (required)
*   `learn`: `[LearnItemSchema]`
*   `test`: `[TestItemSchema]`
*   `exercise`: `[ExerciseItemSchema]`
*   `order`: `Number` (default: 1)
*   `isActive`: `Boolean` (default: true)
*   `careerTrack`: `String` (enum: 'full-stack', 'ai-ml', 'ui-ux', 'data-science', required)
*   `difficulty`: `String` (enum: 'beginner', 'intermediate', 'advanced', default: 'beginner')
*   `estimatedDuration`: `Number` (default: 30)
*   `tags`: `[String]`
*   `prerequisites`: `[String]`
*   `learningObjectives`: `[String]`
*   `resources`: `[ResourceSchema]`
*   `metadata`: `MetadataSchema`

#### `LearnItemSchema`

*   `type`: `String` (enum: 'video', 'reading', 'slide', 'other')
*   `title`: `String`
*   `content`: `String`
*   `videoUrl`: `String`
*   `order`: `Number`

#### `TestItemSchema`

*   `question`: `String`
*   `options`: `[String]`
*   `answer`: `String`
*   `order`: `Number`

#### `ExerciseItemSchema`

*   `title`: `String`
*   `description`: `String`
*   `resources`: `[String]`
*   `order`: `Number`

#### `ResourceSchema`

*   `title`: `String` (required)
*   `url`: `String`
*   `type`: `String` (enum: 'video', 'article', 'document', 'external')
*   `description`: `String`

#### `MetadataSchema`

*   `createdBy`: `ObjectId` (ref: 'User', required)
*   `lastModifiedBy`: `ObjectId` (ref: 'User')
*   `version`: `Number` (default: 1)
*   `publishedAt`: `Date`
*   `publishedBy`: `ObjectId` (ref: 'User')

### `Attendance`

*   `user`: `ObjectId` (ref: 'User', required)
*   `date`: `Date` (required)
*   `status`: `String` (enum: 'present', 'absent', default: 'present')

### `Settings`

*   `general`: `GeneralSettingsSchema`
*   `notifications`: `NotificationSettingsSchema`
*   `security`: `SecuritySettingsSchema`
*   `integrations`: `IntegrationSettingsSchema`

#### `GeneralSettingsSchema`

*   `platformName`: `String`
*   `supportEmail`: `String`
*   `maxStudentsPerAdmin`: `Number`
*   `sessionTimeout`: `Number`
*   `maintenanceMode`: `Boolean`
*   `siteName`: `String`
*   `siteDescription`: `String`
*   `allowRegistration`: `Boolean`

#### `NotificationSettingsSchema`

*   `emailNotifications`: `Boolean`
*   `progressUpdates`: `Boolean`
*   `systemAlerts`: `Boolean`
*   `weeklyReports`: `Boolean`
*   `pushNotifications`: `Boolean`

#### `SecuritySettingsSchema`

*   `passwordMinLength`: `Number`
*   `requireTwoFactor`: `Boolean`
*   `sessionSecurity`: `String`
*   `apiRateLimit`: `Number`
*   `dataRetentionDays`: `Number`
*   `requireEmailVerification`: `Boolean`
*   `sessionTimeout`: `Number`
*   `maxLoginAttempts`: `Number`

#### `IntegrationSettingsSchema`

*   `geminiApiKey`: `String`
*   `emailProvider`: `String`
*   `analyticsEnabled`: `Boolean`
*   `backupEnabled`: `Boolean`
